Z||000034||artherd||10-30-2001||03:40 AM||||Send me some MEPGs! Ben@cartsys.com.  I challenge you to fill up my mail server, betcha can't!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Love the car, and so does everyone I show it to.  Infact, your car singlehandedly converted a mustang ('69, he's into the GOOD mustangs  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> friend of mine.  Used to make fun of fieros (all in jest, of course) but upon seeing your car just once, he flipped completely. We're talking toung-tied, jaw hitting the floor, forgetting to inhale, struck dumb speechless, drool rolling down the cheek AWE!<P>Now he wants one of his own in a bad way.  (and he bames you and Archie personally  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>So yeah, send me everything you've got  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
